      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Put it in your Instructions: state the assumption behind any aggregate, in one\nsentence, every time. It costs nothing, and it is the only place the error is visible.",
